-- Repository deployment readiness remains on hold: full TypeScript timed out after 304 seconds without diagnostics, although the focused 10-root compiler check is green.
-- Phase 3 / Slice 3 is selected but not yet implemented; detector work remains unauthorized until stable case identity is certified and reviewed.
